    "detailed_description": "This is a synchronous turn-based card battle game, you will form your own card deck through the combination of characters, weapons and equipment, to meet any challenges, currently support 1V1 battle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game characteristic gameplay</h2><br>1, synchronous out of the card<br>Play card in the same time with your opponent, avoid turn-based waiting and first hand problems<br><br>2. Interactive battles<br>Use the transposition mechanism to avoid the opponent's possible attack, and use the normal attack card to directly cut down the opponent's powerful skills<br><br>3. The second-level group card mechanism reduces the learning cost<br>It consists of 8 hero and weapon cards to form the whole card group, and introduces the one-key card group function,it will greatly reduce the learning cost",
